Renamed flat (profile id + handedness) rather than kept in the registry's
nested layout: `workers/view/build.mjs` lists vendored binaries BY NAME and
`demoFiles()`/`shellFiles()` enumerate one directory level only, so a nested
path would need the wall widened. The profile id is in the filename because the
profile id is what `XRInputSource.profiles` reports and therefore what the
loader keys on — the name and the lookup are the same string.

Read by demo/shell/xr-glb.mjs, which implements only what these two files use.
